  "ontology_implications": [
    "I1: Entity needs dual granularity - station-level (Substation, PumpStation) AND node-level (Bus, Pump) with CONTAINS mapping",
    "I2: Relation needs explicitness field - formula/qualitative/requirement to preserve material-specific expression",
    "I3: Attribute needs precision field - simulation/rated/semi-quantitative/qualitative to distinguish source quality",
    "I4: BackupPower and SCADA_requirement are unique to standards/reports, not found in papers - must be added as optional entities",
    "I5: Safety thresholds from standards (N-1, Kp>=1.05, leak_rate<=12%) serve as model constraint parameters",
    "I6: No standard covers water-power interdependency - this gap itself is a research finding for the knowledge graph",
    "I7: CascadeEvent needs expression_type: model (paper), narrative (report/plan/event), requirement (standard)",
    "I8: Report and standard both use station-level entities, confirming station-level as the common ground for M2/M3/M4/M5"
  ]
